&lt;td&gt;Light mode test in Tech Site 34&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Chicxulub Crater, Mexico&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;Unintentional Test. Determined to be in reasonable safety limits for foundation staff.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Testing with Small Screen (iPhone) and Large Screen (MacBook Air)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Larger screen produced more waves of GOD ALMIGHTY. Both resulted in an excess of 78 million casualties.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;Request to discontinue testing has been denied. The stated reason for this is &amp;quot;Fuck you we&#039;re scientists, not the ethics committee.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Mass simultaneous testing in Madagascar&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Madagascar instantaneously destroyed.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;Significant calls for monetary compensation of those who lost their homes in the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;destruction&lt;/span&gt; deletion of Madagascar.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Mass simultaneous testing in Brazil&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;See updated world map.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;Can&#039;t be too sure in science!&lt;/em&gt; - Dr Bright.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-8839-j/mapzone.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; class=&quot;enlarge&quot; alt=&quot;mapzone.jpg&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated world map. Hover to enlarge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Testing suspended after &#039;unacceptable casualties&#039; under a unanimous decision of the ethics committee. Fucking bureaucrats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As foundation efforts have caused large amounts of ecological and civilian disruption, maintenance of the veil became utmost priority. Foundation efforts explain massive alterations as the result of deforestation campaigns, accidental nuclear destruction and &#039;sudden tectonic activity&#039;. Public perception of World Leaders drops to 0% following these efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;III.&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;Log&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Close&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr Frederick Jones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr Anna Jameson&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; Psychiatric examination conducted on Dr Anna Jameson (23, Female) after she professed her enjoyment of SCP-8839-J over the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;dark theme&lt;/span&gt; regular theme. This occurred due to the clear denial of objective facts by this researcher suggesting that she was a) delusional, b) unserious, or c) possibly infected with an unknown memetic agent(s).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;BEGIN LOG&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr Jameson and Dr Jones are separated by a glass partition, in order to protect from possible memetic agents. Dr Jameson is restrained with handcuffs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jameson:&lt;/strong&gt; So uhh&amp;#8230; Dr Jameson&amp;#8230; did you - uh - handcuff me to the chair because I like SCiPNET light theme? &lt;em&gt;[pauses]&lt;/em&gt; If so&amp;#8230; I&#039;ll probably have to report that to our superiors&amp;#8230; bud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jones:&lt;/strong&gt; Wow&amp;#8230; there it is - yikes, you&#039;re fucking infected. How can you be so dumb, you dipshit? The interview is on the order of the O5 council, you fuckass&amp;#8230;&lt;em&gt;[sighs]&lt;/em&gt; smooth-brain ass dickball. Do you realise how many people died from SCP-8839-J? &lt;em&gt;[yelling]&lt;/em&gt; DO. YOU. REALISE?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jameson:&lt;/strong&gt; What the fuck? No ones died - wait&amp;#8230; &lt;em&gt;[laughs]&lt;/em&gt; are you calling the light theme an SCP? Oh my god. Did I fall into a coma and wake up on April fools?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jones:&lt;/strong&gt; YOU. ARE. SUFFERING. FROM. A. FUCKING. DELUSION. Do you hear me? Do ya&#039;? I hope you fucking die - in fact, I&#039;d happily kill you right now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jameson:&lt;/strong&gt; Woah&amp;#8230; dude. This isn&#039;t funny. Please stop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jones:&lt;/strong&gt; Do you think this is a joke? Do ya&#039;? I&#039;ll give you something to laugh at&amp;#8230; I&#039;ll show you just how bad this fucking thing is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr Jones calls his superiors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Jones:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello? Yeah&amp;#8230; Jamesons infected. Permission to demonstrate SCP-8839-J? &lt;em&gt;[pauses]&lt;/em&gt; Uh-huh. &lt;em&gt;[pauses]&lt;/em&gt; Okay. Whatever you say, boss. I&#039;ll do it now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr Jones types into his terminal. He pushes &lt;tt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/tt&gt;, and prepares to activate SCP-8839-J. He activates the anomaly and a wave of HOLY SHIT&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-179719-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; emerges from his screen. Contact with Site-17 is lost.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doggol&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6991250&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606489127&quot; alt=&quot;Doggol&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6991250)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doggol&quot;  &gt;Doggol&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-179719-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. A cognitohazard which proves objectively that life is worthless, illogical, and disgusting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-179719-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Namely Detriot, Michigan&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-179719-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Technical Term for the colour emitted by SCP-8839-J. In comparison, White looks black.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
