&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:32;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://live.staticflickr.com/3068/2768392379_3a4cb975ce_b.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:32;&quot; alt=&quot;2768392379_3a4cb975ce_b.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:32;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5156 inside a subjects body.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 is to be kept in a 1767.84 centimeters wide cell with special NORA security cameras and iron doors due to SCP-5156&#039;s exceptional strength.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 is a six foot tall humanoid that looks roughly like a king with white eyes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5156 is able to merge with anything granting it the body and/or powers due to it&#039;s virus.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-705929-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5156 can speak english, spanish, and french.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5156 is very intelligent and is able to learn very quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5156 can&#039;t attack the person they morph into due to being in the body and if the body SCP-5156 is in gets destroyed so does SCP-5156.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 was first discovered on 11/██/███ in a factory at ██████ and was found by J████ B████ during a security search at the █████ factory. SCP-5156 was trying to attack J████ B████ due to unknows reasons. SCP-5156 was in a 6 foot box when found for unknown reasons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum.6467.1:&lt;/strong&gt; Due to SCP-5156&#039;s ability to speak our researchers were able to get a interview with SCP-5156&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;log&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Close&amp;nbsp;interview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; ██████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; The point of the interview is to find out why SCP-5156 was in a box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello SCP-5156 today you are here so we can find out why you were in a box got it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; Got it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; So first question why were you in a factory?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; Well it&#039;s because of my owner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Who is this &amp;quot;owner&amp;quot;?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; Their name was █████████ ██████████ I think.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Ok and now why were you in a box?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; Well once I got in the factory it was like she wanted to send me somewhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; So what happened after that?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[SCP-5156 starts to look around the room]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; Well it was like I was in her body and after I was in I started to cause chaos since I felt betrayed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes so how did you get into the box?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5156:&lt;/strong&gt; well I fell out of her body and into the box everybody said I was too dangerous and just kept me in there with the lid closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Thank you for your time SCP-5156 you are free to go back to your room now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; After the interview SCP-5156 was taken back to it&#039;s cell and the research team started to see if they could get more information about █████████ ██████████ no progress has been achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum.6467.2:&lt;/strong&gt; To research SCP-5156&#039;s ability to morph into anything a test was preformed on D-34734.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;log&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Close&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;log&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Test Number: 1/1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subject: D-34734&lt;br /&gt;
Time: June 27th 4:43 PM EST&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-34734 was placed in SCP-5156&#039;s room with two guards near the door.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 went into D-34734&#039;s body as planned and started causing chaos. While the chaos happened a guard removed SCP-5156 from D-34734&#039;s body&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 can cause chaos inside a body but it it very easy to stop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
