				<title>News for September 2020</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/news-09-2020</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;« &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-08-2020&quot;&gt;August 2020&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-09-2020&quot;&gt;September 2020&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; | &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-10-2020&quot;&gt;October 2020&lt;/a&gt; »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:75%;&quot;&gt;This is a series showing off news from the site, articles from the past month&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-504373-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, and fan-content for you to check out and discover! Be sure to leave a comment with your thoughts!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Fandom Stuff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gofundme.com/f/scp-legal-funds&quot;&gt;A hearing&lt;/a&gt; in the SCP trademark case took place this month. Another court session was scheduled for next month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/&quot;&gt;SCP-FR&lt;/a&gt; has a new domain - &lt;a href=&quot;http://fondationscp.fr/&quot;&gt;http://fondationscp.fr/&lt;/a&gt; - that redirects visitors to the SCP-FR wiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-de.wikidot.com/&quot;&gt;SCP-DE&lt;/a&gt;&#039;s mentor system that helps newcomers to the site now has &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-de.wikidot.com/mentoren&quot;&gt;an information page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SCP-DE also accepted a large side canon - &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-de.wikidot.com/projekt-trickster&quot;&gt;Project Trickster&lt;/a&gt; - into the official DE canon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-es.com/&quot;&gt;SCP-ES&lt;/a&gt; is continuing its frequent micro-contests that take place on the forums. &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-es.com/forum/t-13698749/de-regreso-a-las-andadas:reto-de-escritura&quot;&gt;The lastest one&lt;/a&gt; was constrained to take place over the course of just five hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The latest of &lt;a href=&quot;http://ko.scp-wiki.net/&quot;&gt;SCP-KO&lt;/a&gt;&#039;s &lt;a href=&quot;http://ko.scp-wiki.net/bimonthly-contests-2020#toc4&quot;&gt;bimonthly contests&lt;/a&gt; concluded this month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Featured Articles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4823&quot;&gt;SCP-4823&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;The Whole World Has Gone Bananas&amp;quot;) by Serabus&lt;br /&gt;
Featured by Ocuin, Flopmind, and REDESERT&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following entry, SCP-4823 will unpeel itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/remember&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;REMEMBER&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt; by Cerastes&lt;br /&gt;
Featured by Truc Linh, Comrade Waldo, and Dr Sage Evergreen&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cain didn&#039;t have the luxury of forgetting why he did it&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scpwiki.com/a-song-that-is-unfortunately-about-toes&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Single: untitled&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt; by oboebandgeek99&lt;br /&gt;
Featured by KaraKatt and Dr Gallium&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is inspired by true things(ish) I&#039;ve embellished the story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reviewer&#039;s Spotlight Articles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5380&quot;&gt;SCP-5380&lt;/a&gt;: My World by chiifu featured by KaraKatt&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5595&quot;&gt;SCP-5595&lt;/a&gt;: Geoffrey Quincy Harrison the Third: Site-Director, Gumball Machine by PlaguePJPfeatured by redesert&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/i-just-wanna-survive&quot;&gt;I Don&#039;t Wanna Be Special (I Just Wanna Survive)&lt;/a&gt; by OboeBandGeek99&lt;br /&gt;
featured by Naveil&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5335&quot;&gt;SCP-5335&lt;/a&gt;: The Freudian Split by MalyceGraves&lt;br /&gt;
